Stalkers! 

We present you a list of changes included in today's patch-fix:

— Fixed an issue that caused the character to stop when opening/closing the visor on the K6-3 helmet while moving.

— Fixed a similar issue that caused the character to stop when wearing on/off the glasses while moving.

— The 14th PvP season starts this Saturday, 28.09.24.
The season will last from [b]28.09.24[/b] to [b]23.11.24[/b].

Also in Season 14, weapon rewards were changed:

1 place: SR3M;
2 place: SR3 «Vihr»;
3 place: AK-107;
4 place: WA2000;
5 place: М16А4;
6 place: VSS «Vintorez»; 
7 place: AS «Val»;
8 place: SIG SG550;
9 place: AK-109;
10 place: SIG SG552 «Commando».

All other items remain the same as last season.

Sincerely,
SO Team

[list]
[*] Now players can skip the tutorial by pressing on the appropriate button;
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36091145/27ec2e28ad7de18c16ea265658d38cf48a67aaf8.png[/img]
[*] A box with things from the guide, at the beginning of the station, now appears immediately in the inventory, and not on the stone, next to the player;
[*] Added ability to edit the character’s face from the main menu;
[/list]
Have a good game!
